# ==============================================================================
# Figure 1. Evaluation of facility-level emission-factor models
#
# Panels (a) and (b): independent-holdout observed versus predicted EFs.
# Panels (c) and (d): annual CAMPD-reported versus XGBoost-reconstructed
#                     emissions in independent-holdout facilities, 1997-2020.
#
# Required inputs:
#   TableS4_holdout_predictions.csv
#   annual-emissions-facility-aggregation-1995-2020-CAMPD.csv
# ==============================================================================

